      "message": "Can we stop the request along with erasing the entry? Currently if the eid is removed while a request is in flight, removing this entry does not stop the request.",
      "revId": "55c003903960d2f8ece90803f968685370ef22f7",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
